asl-sentence-end-punctuation $ . ;.
$.#409
|  Still,
|  I believe these analogies imply a precis of the
|  syntax/semantics interface that is more cognitively realistic
.  than 's appeal to commutative diagrams
asl-sentence-text $# 409 ;.

asl-new-sentence 4# 403 ;.
